tests:
cd /home/user/AI-works/circuit-output-fraction/code && python3 -m pytest -q tests: 230 passed (about 70 s), run twice after the final edits.

New tests in code/tests/test_fix_cftp.py:
- test_empty_cnf (crashed on HEAD);
- test_janson_delta_unordered (HEAD gave Delta=0.25);
- test_subnormal_harris_and_janson (1061 unit clauses at 12.8, 13.4, 13.6, 2.6, 0.6 and 1000.4 units of 2^-1074, exact rational p; HEAD fails both the lower end and the upper end);
- test_exp_bounds_and_statistical_ends (exp_down, exp_up and _stat_interval against 60-digit decimal arithmetic across the subnormal range).

Additional checks in scratch:
- 200k random _stat_interval and exp_down/exp_up cases against Decimal: 0 violations;
- 15k random near-subnormal Janson/Harris instances against exact rationals: new code 0 misses, HEAD 1;
- 120 random small unate CNFs against exact rational p at delta=0.2: 0 misses;
- LaTeX build of a scratch copy of paper/: no errors from p1-cftp.tex.

